Bone Box was added in '''Beta 36.0''' as one of the cards using the new mechanic of "choose one" effects. In this case, looking at 3 random (craftable) spells with a cost of 3G or lower and let you choose one of them to be added to your hand. '''Beta 48.0''' gave it +1/+1, buffing it from 3/2/2 to 3/3/3.

=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 2 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 48.0, Current)
HP:
* 2 (Post Beta 36.0)
* 3 (Post Beta 48.0, Current)
Cost: 3

Ability: Magic: See 3 random <= 3G spells. Choose 1. Add it to your hand.

Rarity: White (Common)[[Category:Rework]]